Warning: Major spoiler alert! Press 'n' now to skip! (Well sorta)


At the bottom of the dungeon there is a rite to be performed involving the
traditional equipment of Bell, Book and Candle. At one point you will (if
you're lucky :-) ) find a Candleabrum (sp?) which needs seven candles...
There's also a luckstone (and a bunch of others) hidden at the bottom of the
Gnomish Mines.

